{"id":"sl/y90nupkv","index":0,"title":"个人校准解码与重叠感知序贯决策 · 2026 年 10 月","elements":[{"id":"sh/65g3298r","kind":"textbox","name":"文本占位符 4","text":"个人校准解码与重叠感知序贯决策 · 2026 年 10 月","position":{"left":223.47,"top":546.67,"width":789.87,"height":78.67}},{"id":"sh/sryl4zqx","kind":"textbox","name":"文本占位符 6","text":"汇报人：________","position":{"left":311.87,"top":457.47,"width":614.8,"height":71.07}},{"id":"im/3ylkn65k","kind":"image","name":"图片 99","position":{"left":359.67,"top":15.73,"width":519.2,"height":158.27}},{"id":"sh/ts7md4r2","kind":"textbox","name":"副标题 8","text":"面向脑控无人机的 SSVEP 在线识别稳定性研究","position":{"left":64.61,"top":192.13,"width":1150.78,"height":185.42}}],"notes":{"text":"本报告基于现有项目、现场采集记录与本地论文复现情况整理。题目聚焦在线识别稳定性，而不是无人机任务分配。\n本地参考论文：/Users/geniusalu/Desktop/论文.pdf"}}
{"id":"sl/hwbqtkby","index":1,"title":"目 录","elements":[{"id":"sh/2l4r6hc7","kind":"textbox","name":"Object 107","text":"目 录","position":{"left":582.3,"top":85.69,"width":172.86,"height":105.1}},{"id":"sh/ls7mtobu","kind":"shape","name":"直接连接符 90","position":{"left":158.45,"top":203.07,"width":963.1,"height":0}},{"id":"sh/ypgny9sj","kind":"textbox","name":"文本框 91","text":"CONTENTS","position":{"left":856.93,"top":144.99,"width":251.5,"height":54.07}},{"id":"sh/zqp4ret4","kind":"textbox","name":"文本框 92","text":"1. 介绍背景\n2. 问题是什么？\n3. 为什么重要？\n4. 挑战与难点\n5. 已有方法（文献综述）\n6. 尚未解决的难点\n7. 拟议创新与主要贡献\n8. 方法细节\n9. 实验验证方案与当前基线\n10. 总结","position":{"left":158.45,"top":215.27,"width":963.1,"height":383.45}},{"id":"im/lczil8jm","kind":"image","name":"图片 2","position":{"left":5,"top":0,"width":191.87,"height":190.87}}],"notes":{"text":"目录严格对应老师要求的十部分结构。第 7—9 部分采用‘拟议方法—待验证’表述，避免把尚未完成的实验写成结论。"}}
{"id":"sl/ofy9wn61","index":2,"title":"1  研究背景：SSVEP 脑控无人机","elements":[{"id":"sh/i9w3u58v","kind":"textbox","text":"1  研究背景：SSVEP 脑控无人机","position":{"left":40,"top":36,"width":1010,"height":55}},{"id":"sh/cza94vmx","kind":"shape","position":{"left":1085,"top":42,"width":112,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/d0jax03i","kind":"textbox","text":"背景","position":{"left":1088,"top":43,"width":106,"height":32}},{"id":"im/7ut4nih0","kind":"image","position":{"left":55,"top":125,"width":390,"height":330}},{"id":"im/6tknud0f","kind":"image","position":{"left":475,"top":125,"width":742,"height":330}},{"id":"sh/obq90bml","kind":"shape","position":{"left":55,"top":480,"width":360,"height":170}},{"id":"sh/pcjqtg36","kind":"shape","position":{"left":55,"top":480,"width":8,"height":170}},{"id":"sh/m5cra54z","kind":"textbox","text":"任务目标","position":{"left":73,"top":494,"width":324,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/n6ls3alk","kind":"textbox","text":"用户注视某一闪烁目标，系统把对应频率解码为起飞、前进、后退、左移、右移或降落。","position":{"left":73,"top":536,"width":324,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/n2l4fq98","kind":"shape","position":{"left":460,"top":480,"width":350,"height":170}},{"id":"sh/m1c3mlsn","kind":"shape","position":{"left":460,"top":480,"width":8,"height":170}},{"id":"sh/943mhgre","kind":"textbox","text":"当前路线","position":{"left":478,"top":494,"width":314,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/83ulovat","kind":"textbox","text":"8–13 Hz 六频刺激；FBCCA、Transformer 与个人模板均已尝试，现阶段默认走个人模板融合。","position":{"left":478,"top":536,"width":314,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/v6l4jq94","kind":"shape","position":{"left":855,"top":480,"width":362,"height":170}},{"id":"sh/a5c3ql8z","kind":"shape","position":{"left":855,"top":480,"width":8,"height":170}},{"id":"sh/x8nml0ra","kind":"textbox","text":"研究边界","position":{"left":873,"top":494,"width":326,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/w7ulsvqp","kind":"textbox","text":"本研究聚焦“看哪个就识别哪个”的稳定解码，不研究蜂群任务分配或无人机调度。","position":{"left":873,"top":536,"width":326,"height":100}},{"id":"sh/ja54na9g","kind":"textbox","text":"数据来源：项目实时界面与设备照片（2026-10）；界面截图仅作系统现状展示","position":{"left":42,"top":691,"width":1120,"height":20}}],"notes":{"text":"讲解重点：系统已具备硬件接入、刺激呈现、实时采集和多种解码器，但核心问题仍是在线意图识别不稳定。\n图片来源：用户提供的设备照片和项目界面截图。\n本地项目：/Users/geniusalu/Documents/brain-drone-swarm-console；/Users/geniusalu/Desktop/brain-drone-swarm-server"}}
{"id":"sl/jyx0ra1s","index":3,"title":"2  问题是什么？——“有输出”不等于“识别正确”","elements":[{"id":"sh/w72947yt","kind":"textbox","text":"2  问题是什么？——“有输出”不等于“识别正确”","position":{"left":40,"top":36,"width":1010,"height":55}},{"id":"sh/1cj2d8b6","kind":"shape","position":{"left":1085,"top":42,"width":112,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/0ba143al","kind":"textbox","text":"问题","position":{"left":1088,"top":43,"width":106,"height":32}},{"id":"sh/rm1k7yt4","kind":"textbox","text":"核心问题：在自由注视的在线场景中，分类器会稳定地产生错误指令，或在阈值稍严时完全不输出。","position":{"left":70,"top":108,"width":1135,"height":54}},{"id":"tb/fu5cvqds","kind":"table","text":"环节\t当前证据\t结果\t正确解释\nFBCCA 在线\t六目标自由注视\t频繁误触发 / 阈值严时拒识\t尚无逐试次标准答案，不能凭屏幕输出计算准确率\nTransformer\t78 条训练、27 条验证\t验证准确率 7.4%；空闲误触发率 100%\t低于 7 类随机基线 14.3%，当前模型不可用\n个人模板融合\t60 段单目标数据，每类 10 段\t留一试次一致性 38.3%\t仅是内部一致性，不是独立在线准确率\n在线判决\t4 s 窗，0.25 s 更新\t相邻窗口重叠 93.75%\t连续判断高度相关，不能当作独立证据","position":{"left":60,"top":185,"width":1160,"height":355}},{"id":"sh/doj29oba","kind":"shape","position":{"left":60,"top":563,"width":565,"height":92}},{"id":"sh/sna103ap","kind":"shape","position":{"left":60,"top":563,"width":8,"height":92}},{"id":"sh/3ihk3et8","kind":"textbox","text":"需要回答的科学问题","position":{"left":78,"top":577,"width":529,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/ih8ju9sn","kind":"textbox","text":"如何在低信噪比、少校准数据和强窗口相关性下，提高在线识别正确率并抑制错误指令？","position":{"left":78,"top":619,"width":529,"height":22}},{"id":"sh/kbm987y5","kind":"shape","position":{"left":655,"top":563,"width":565,"height":92}},{"id":"sh/5cva1cfq","kind":"shape","position":{"left":655,"top":563,"width":8,"height":92}},{"id":"sh/i94r6xgz","kind":"textbox","text":"当前不能声称的结论","position":{"left":673,"top":577,"width":529,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/jadsz2xk","kind":"textbox","text":"不能把“模板识别 4 轮”“屏幕有指令”或 38.3% 内部一致性写成真实在线准确率。","position":{"left":673,"top":619,"width":529,"height":22}}],"notes":{"text":"数据来自当前项目模型元数据和个人模板报告。Transformer：78 train / 27 validation，validation accuracy=7.4074%，macro-F1=2.857%，idle false activation=100%。个人模板：60 trials，LOO consistency=38.33%。\n强调：这里把‘问题’从主观感受转换为可检验指标。随机基线：7 类含 idle 时约 14.3%；6 指令类约 16.7%。"}}
{"id":"sl/i107q5of","index":4,"title":"3  为什么这个问题很重要？","elements":[{"id":"sh/ehkzepsn","kind":"textbox","text":"3  为什么这个问题很重要？","position":{"left":40,"top":36,"width":1010,"height":55}},{"id":"sh/dgbulwnm","kind":"shape","position":{"left":1085,"top":42,"width":112,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/cf2tcr61","kind":"textbox","text":"重要性","position":{"left":1088,"top":43,"width":106,"height":32}},{"id":"sh/z2tcnm5s","kind":"shape","position":{"left":60,"top":170,"width":245,"height":155}},{"id":"sh/yhkbe1o7","kind":"textbox","text":"01","position":{"left":78,"top":186,"width":50,"height":40}},{"id":"sh/l4bupwny","kind":"textbox","text":"频率误判","position":{"left":132,"top":187,"width":155,"height":38}},{"id":"sh/032tgr6d","kind":"textbox","text":"看前进，却识别为起飞","position":{"left":80,"top":240,"width":205,"height":65}},{"id":"sh/n6dcr65o","kind":"shape","position":{"left":314,"top":235,"width":34,"height":24}},{"id":"sh/m5kbi1oj","kind":"shape","position":{"left":360,"top":170,"width":245,"height":155}},{"id":"sh/w32dkbuh","kind":"textbox","text":"02","position":{"left":378,"top":186,"width":50,"height":40}},{"id":"sh/x4vedgvm","kind":"textbox","text":"意图误译","position":{"left":432,"top":187,"width":155,"height":38}},{"id":"sh/ahkvi1cb","kind":"textbox","text":"用户意图与指令不一致","position":{"left":380,"top":240,"width":205,"height":65}},{"id":"sh/v2twb6dw","kind":"shape","position":{"left":614,"top":235,"width":34,"height":24}},{"id":"sh/k7mxovud","kind":"shape","position":{"left":660,"top":170,"width":245,"height":155}},{"id":"sh/58vehgvy","kind":"textbox","text":"03","position":{"left":678,"top":186,"width":50,"height":40}},{"id":"sh/i54fmlc7","kind":"textbox","text":"控制误触发","position":{"left":732,"top":187,"width":155,"height":38}},{"id":"sh/j6dwfqds","kind":"textbox","text":"错误动作被连续发送","position":{"left":680,"top":240,"width":205,"height":65}},{"id":"sh/sb6xsvu9","kind":"shape","position":{"left":914,"top":235,"width":34,"height":24}},{"id":"sh/tcfel0vu","kind":"shape","position":{"left":960,"top":170,"width":245,"height":155}},{"id":"sh/hgrmpwj2","kind":"textbox","text":"04","position":{"left":978,"top":186,"width":50,"height":40}},{"id":"sh/gfi5grih","kind":"textbox","text":"系统风险","position":{"left":1032,"top":187,"width":155,"height":38}},{"id":"sh/fe94nm1w","kind":"textbox","text":"安全性、可用性与信任下降","position":{"left":980,"top":240,"width":205,"height":65}},{"id":"sh/ud0ne10b","kind":"textbox","text":"因此，评价指标不能只有离线分类准确率","position":{"left":70,"top":375,"width":1135,"height":48}},{"id":"sh/pkr6tgjy","kind":"shape","position":{"left":65,"top":455,"width":260,"height":150}},{"id":"sh/4ji5kbid","kind":"shape","position":{"left":65,"top":455,"width":8,"height":150}},{"id":"sh/3i94r61s","kind":"textbox","text":"ACC / Macro-F1","position":{"left":83,"top":469,"width":224,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/2h0ni107","kind":"textbox","text":"识别是否正确","position":{"left":83,"top":511,"width":224,"height":80}},{"id":"sh/5o7mhcju","kind":"shape","position":{"left":362,"top":455,"width":260,"height":150}},{"id":"sh/kny587i9","kind":"shape","position":{"left":362,"top":455,"width":8,"height":150}},{"id":"sh/atcjidg7","kind":"textbox","text":"FTR/min","position":{"left":380,"top":469,"width":224,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/vu5kbihc","kind":"textbox","text":"每分钟错误触发","position":{"left":380,"top":511,"width":224,"height":80}},{"id":"sh/wve1knyx","kind":"shape","position":{"left":659,"top":455,"width":260,"height":150}},{"id":"sh/xwn2dszi","kind":"shape","position":{"left":659,"top":455,"width":8,"height":150}},{"id":"sh/ihw3mxg3","kind":"textbox","text":"Latency","position":{"left":677,"top":469,"width":224,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/ji5kf2ho","kind":"textbox","text":"决策等待时间","position":{"left":677,"top":511,"width":224,"height":80}},{"id":"sh/kjelony9","kind":"shape","position":{"left":956,"top":455,"width":260,"height":150}},{"id":"sh/5kn2hszu","kind":"shape","position":{"left":956,"top":455,"width":8,"height":150}},{"id":"sh/e1sjatgz","kind":"textbox","text":"ITR","position":{"left":974,"top":469,"width":224,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/zmlk3yhk","kind":"textbox","text":"速度—准确率权衡","position":{"left":974,"top":511,"width":224,"height":80}},{"id":"sh/fid07u98","kind":"textbox","text":"在线脑控应同时报告正确性、误触发与时延；单独追求输出频率会掩盖安全问题","position":{"left":42,"top":691,"width":1120,"height":20}}],"notes":{"text":"这一页把识别错误与无人机控制后果连起来。后续实验以 cue-guided ground truth 为准，分别报告命令正确率、空闲状态错误触发率、每分钟错误指令数和决策时延。"}}
{"id":"sl/x8f69ofe","index":5,"title":"4  挑战与难点：信号、刺激、数据、决策相互耦合","elements":[{"id":"sh/qpwnet0b","kind":"textbox","text":"4  挑战与难点：信号、刺激、数据、决策相互耦合","position":{"left":40,"top":36,"width":1010,"height":55}},{"id":"sh/yhg7epsj","kind":"shape","position":{"left":1085,"top":42,"width":112,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/zi98nu94","kind":"textbox","text":"挑战","position":{"left":1088,"top":43,"width":106,"height":32}},{"id":"ch/kve5sred","kind":"chart","name":"Chart","position":{"left":55,"top":135,"width":670,"height":440}},{"id":"sh/98rqt4r6","kind":"shape","position":{"left":760,"top":135,"width":455,"height":112}},{"id":"sh/ml07i9sv","kind":"shape","position":{"left":760,"top":135,"width":8,"height":112}},{"id":"sh/7m98ru9g","kind":"textbox","text":"① 信号质量","position":{"left":778,"top":149,"width":419,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/oryp8fah","kind":"textbox","text":"厚头发、干电极接触、REF/GND 与工频干扰会使有效通道数量波动。","position":{"left":778,"top":191,"width":419,"height":42}},{"id":"sh/pc76hkr2","kind":"shape","position":{"left":760,"top":262,"width":455,"height":112}},{"id":"sh/h4bupgn6","kind":"shape","position":{"left":760,"top":262,"width":8,"height":112}},{"id":"sh/w32twb6l","kind":"textbox","text":"② 刺激一致性","position":{"left":778,"top":276,"width":419,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/v2tcn650","kind":"textbox","text":"单目标校准与六目标同时闪烁的视觉竞争、位置和亮度并不等价。","position":{"left":778,"top":318,"width":419,"height":42}},{"id":"sh/u1kbu1ov","kind":"shape","position":{"left":760,"top":389,"width":455,"height":112}},{"id":"sh/5svutgni","kind":"shape","position":{"left":760,"top":389,"width":8,"height":112}},{"id":"sh/47mt0b6x","kind":"textbox","text":"③ 小样本与漂移","position":{"left":778,"top":403,"width":419,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/j6dcr65c","kind":"textbox","text":"跨时段、跨佩戴的幅值和相位会改变，单日模板容易过拟合。","position":{"left":778,"top":445,"width":419,"height":42}},{"id":"sh/i54bylor","kind":"shape","position":{"left":760,"top":516,"width":455,"height":112}},{"id":"sh/twfux0ne","kind":"shape","position":{"left":760,"top":516,"width":8,"height":112}},{"id":"sh/svmt4v6t","kind":"textbox","text":"④ 在线证据相关","position":{"left":778,"top":530,"width":419,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/cbe5g3ih","kind":"textbox","text":"4 s 窗每 0.25 s 更新，相邻输出主要来自同一批样本。","position":{"left":778,"top":572,"width":419,"height":42}},{"id":"sh/dcnm98zm","kind":"textbox","text":"注：通道可用率是本批 60 段校准数据的质量统计，不代表生理响应强度","position":{"left":42,"top":691,"width":1120,"height":20}}],"notes":{"text":"图表来自个人模板训练数据的通道质量统计：O1 6.7, Oz 100, O2 53.3, PO3 85, POz 50, PO4 98.3, P3 71.7, P4 25。当前个人模型使用 Oz/PO3/PO4/P3，其中 P3 是手动保留，低于原 80% 可用率门槛。\n不要把‘增益放大’等同于信噪比提高：放大会同时放大噪声，关键是接触质量、参考、滤波和可重复性。"}}
{"id":"sl/gnmp4jqx","index":6,"title":"5.1  已有方法：从无训练到个人校准","elements":[{"id":"sh/kzmdova1","kind":"textbox","text":"5.1  已有方法：从无训练到个人校准","position":{"left":40,"top":36,"width":1010,"height":55}},{"id":"sh/cb2tkvap","kind":"shape","position":{"left":1085,"top":42,"width":112,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/dcbud0ra","kind":"textbox","text":"文献综述","position":{"left":1088,"top":43,"width":106,"height":32}},{"id":"tb/vit8vmd8","kind":"table","text":"方法\t核心信息\t校准需求\t主要优点\t主要局限\nCCA\t正弦/余弦参考相关性\t无\t实现简单、可解释\t忽略个体相位与空间结构\nFBCCA\t多子带与谐波加权\t无\t利用谐波，提高稳健性\t仍依赖理想参考；弱响应时易混淆\n训练数据 CCA\t由个人试次学习参考\t少量\t更贴合个体响应\t对跨时段漂移敏感\neTRCA\t最大化跨试次可重复成分\t每类多试次\t个人模板性能强、解释清楚\t需要高质量重复校准\nTDCA\t判别性时空滤波 + 延迟/参考投影\t每类多试次\t短窗和类别分离能力较好\t参数与校准协议仍需严格验证","position":{"left":50,"top":120,"width":1180,"height":465}},{"id":"sh/zedcfa9g","kind":"textbox","text":"结论：‘个人模板 + FBCCA’属于已有技术组合，本身不足以构成论文创新。","position":{"left":85,"top":610,"width":1110,"height":48}}],"notes":{"text":"主要文献：\nChen et al., Filter bank canonical correlation analysis for implementing a high-speed SSVEP-based brain-computer interface, J Neural Eng, 2015. https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/26035476/\nNakanishi et al., Enhancing Detection of SSVEPs for a High-Speed BCI Using TRCA, IEEE TBME, 2018. https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28436836/\nWei et al., Training-data-driven CCA, Int J Neural Syst, 2020. https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/32380925/\nLiu et al., TDCA, IEEE TNSRE, 2021. https://bingchuanliu.github.io/assets/pdf/liu_tnsre.pdf"}}
{"id":"sl/fu1gfa1s","index":7,"title":"5.2  已有方法：深度学习与自适应通道","elements":[{"id":"sh/zipwbmdc","kind":"textbox","text":"5.2  已有方法：深度学习与自适应通道","position":{"left":40,"top":36,"width":1010,"height":55}},{"id":"sh/18byd4zy","kind":"shape","position":{"left":1085,"top":42,"width":112,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/g72x4zyd","kind":"textbox","text":"文献综述","position":{"left":1088,"top":43,"width":106,"height":32}},{"id":"sh/ri9g7uhw","kind":"shape","position":{"left":60,"top":135,"width":350,"height":430}},{"id":"sh/6h0fypgb","kind":"shape","position":{"left":60,"top":135,"width":8,"height":430}},{"id":"sh/tkby9kzm","kind":"textbox","text":"Transformer / 深度网络","position":{"left":78,"top":149,"width":314,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/sjix0zy1","kind":"textbox","text":"能从时空序列中自动学习特征。\n\n适合：大样本、多被试预训练、严格数据划分。\n\n本项目问题：只有数百条且信号质量不稳定，当前验证准确率 7.4%，网络学不到稳定的类别结构。","position":{"left":78,"top":191,"width":314,"height":360}},{"id":"sh/je9g3ahk","kind":"shape","position":{"left":465,"top":135,"width":350,"height":430}},{"id":"sh/id0fu50z","kind":"shape","position":{"left":465,"top":135,"width":8,"height":430}},{"id":"sh/o7ydoret","kind":"textbox","text":"通道选择与加权","position":{"left":483,"top":149,"width":314,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/98rehwve","kind":"textbox","text":"依据 SNR、工频污染、跨试次可重复性选择或加权通道。\n\n价值：避免 O1/P4 等低质量通道拖累融合。\n\n注意：权重必须只用训练折估计，不能偷看测试标签。","position":{"left":483,"top":191,"width":314,"height":360}},{"id":"sh/m5gvmhwn","kind":"shape","position":{"left":870,"top":135,"width":350,"height":430}},{"id":"sh/n6pwfmd8","kind":"shape","position":{"left":870,"top":135,"width":8,"height":430}},{"id":"sh/0jydkreh","kind":"textbox","text":"跨被试 / 迁移学习","position":{"left":888,"top":149,"width":314,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/1k7edwv2","kind":"textbox","text":"利用其他被试或历史会话减少个人校准。\n\n价值：缓解小样本。\n\n限制：设备、电极位置和刺激时序不一致时，域偏移可能比收益更大。","position":{"left":888,"top":191,"width":314,"height":360}},{"id":"sh/ehgvihwr","kind":"textbox","text":"当前优先级：先把信号与评测协议做可靠，再讨论 Transformer；网络结构不能替代可用数据。","position":{"left":80,"top":595,"width":1120,"height":56}}],"notes":{"text":"当前 Transformer 失败不能推导出‘Transformer 不适合 SSVEP’，只能说明当前数据量、信号质量、标签/频率配置和验证流程不足以支撑该模型。\n近期自适应通道例：Adaptive subject-specific channel and subspace selection TRCA. https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC12944370/"}}
{"id":"sl/udsvah03","index":8,"title":"5.3  已有方法：在线滑动窗与停止策略","elements":[{"id":"sh/xgzitk76","kind":"textbox","text":"5.3  已有方法：在线滑动窗与停止策略","position":{"left":40,"top":36,"width":1010,"height":55}},{"id":"sh/1cfmhgne","kind":"shape","position":{"left":1085,"top":42,"width":112,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/0b65obm9","kind":"textbox","text":"文献综述","position":{"left":1088,"top":43,"width":106,"height":32}},{"id":"sh/nex4jq5k","kind":"textbox","text":"同一段脑电被重复使用","position":{"left":70,"top":108,"width":1140,"height":38}},{"id":"sh/mdonql4z","kind":"shape","position":{"left":100,"top":170,"width":720,"height":56}},{"id":"sh/9gzml0nq","kind":"textbox","text":"窗口 t：4.00 s 数据","position":{"left":100,"top":170,"width":720,"height":56}},{"id":"sh/ofq5svm5","kind":"shape","position":{"left":145,"top":245,"width":720,"height":56}},{"id":"sh/bih4na5w","kind":"textbox","text":"窗口 t+1：仅新增 0.25 s，93.75% 与上窗相同","position":{"left":145,"top":245,"width":720,"height":56}},{"id":"sh/ah8nu54b","kind":"textbox","text":"新增证据","position":{"left":805,"top":310,"width":120,"height":32}},{"id":"sh/oza1gfyh","kind":"shape","position":{"left":820,"top":225,"width":45,"height":76}},{"id":"sh/p0ji9kf2","kind":"shape","position":{"left":910,"top":160,"width":300,"height":155}},{"id":"sh/2xsjepgb","kind":"shape","position":{"left":910,"top":160,"width":8,"height":155}},{"id":"sh/3y107axw","kind":"textbox","text":"论文复现设置","position":{"left":928,"top":174,"width":264,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/cnu1kzyd","kind":"textbox","text":"2 s 窗 / 0.25 s 步长\n重叠 87.5%\n连续 2 次 + 0.6 置信度","position":{"left":928,"top":216,"width":264,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/do3id4fy","kind":"shape","position":{"left":65,"top":370,"width":350,"height":230}},{"id":"sh/qlcjipgn","kind":"shape","position":{"left":65,"top":370,"width":8,"height":230}},{"id":"sh/bml0buxs","kind":"textbox","text":"已有：固定连续确认","position":{"left":83,"top":384,"width":314,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/0ru1ozyp","kind":"textbox","text":"要求连续若干窗口同类。实现简单，但重叠窗口并非独立，错误结果也可能连续出现。","position":{"left":83,"top":426,"width":314,"height":160}},{"id":"sh/lsn2h4fa","kind":"shape","position":{"left":465,"top":370,"width":350,"height":230}},{"id":"sh/98ji147e","kind":"shape","position":{"left":465,"top":370,"width":8,"height":230}},{"id":"sh/87a18zqt","kind":"textbox","text":"已有：自适应窗 / 动态停止","position":{"left":483,"top":384,"width":314,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/76h0zup8","kind":"textbox","text":"根据信心提前停止或延长窗口，已有 FBCCA 自适应窗和校准高效动态停止研究。","position":{"left":483,"top":426,"width":314,"height":160}},{"id":"sh/ml8j6p8n","kind":"shape","position":{"left":865,"top":370,"width":350,"height":230}},{"id":"sh/hcji5o7a","kind":"shape","position":{"left":865,"top":370,"width":8,"height":230}},{"id":"sh/wba1cjqp","kind":"textbox","text":"仍需解决","position":{"left":883,"top":384,"width":314,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/va103ep4","kind":"textbox","text":"怎样估计每次更新真正新增的信息，并让空闲/释放状态参与决策，而不是无限累积重复证据？","position":{"left":883,"top":426,"width":314,"height":160}},{"id":"sh/u9sja98z","kind":"textbox","text":"重叠本身不是错误；问题在于把强相关窗口当成相互独立的重复确认","position":{"left":42,"top":691,"width":1120,"height":20}}],"notes":{"text":"本地复现论文：2 s 窗、0.25 s 步长，87.5% 重叠，连续 2 次、置信度 0.6、冷却 500 ms。论文未对窗口独立性和不同重叠率做消融，因此这里称为‘潜在方法学局限’，不能称为论文错误。\n一般滑动窗独立性讨论：https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3634773/\nAdaptive Window FBCCA: https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/ielx7/7333/10031624/09931747.pdf\nCalibration-efficient dynamic stopping/control-state UAV (2026): https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/11693034/"}}
{"id":"sl/m90b6t0r","index":9,"title":"6  还有哪些未解决的难点？","elements":[{"id":"sh/l036l83y","kind":"textbox","text":"6  还有哪些未解决的难点？","position":{"left":40,"top":36,"width":1010,"height":55}},{"id":"sh/xc3mho32","kind":"shape","position":{"left":1085,"top":42,"width":112,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/cbu58j2h","kind":"textbox","text":"研究空白","position":{"left":1088,"top":43,"width":106,"height":32}},{"id":"tb/mxgvador","kind":"table","text":"未解决难点\t已有方法覆盖\t本项目缺口\t可验证研究问题\n通道质量动态变化\t固定通道 / 离线选择\t佩戴后可用通道每次不同\t质量加权能否降低误触发？\n单目标—多目标域差异\t模板方法通常假设协议一致\t校准与正式界面视觉竞争不同\t相同几何的引导校准是否更稳？\n高度重叠的在线证据\t连续确认 / 动态停止\t当前把强相关窗口重复计数\t按新增信息量修正能否改善稳定性？\n空闲与释放控制\t阈值拒识\t缺少独立 idle 类和释放逻辑\t控制状态机能否降 FTR/min？\n真实在线评估\t离线交叉验证较常见\t缺少逐试次提示与标准答案\t跨会话在线实验能否复现收益？","position":{"left":58,"top":125,"width":1165,"height":440}},{"id":"sh/ydcnatkn","kind":"textbox","text":"研究空白应落到可证伪的问题，而不是“再换一个更复杂的网络”。","position":{"left":100,"top":600,"width":1080,"height":52}}],"notes":{"text":"这一页可作为老师判断‘是否已有方法处理这些问题’的汇总。重点不是声称没人研究，而是说明已有模块分别存在、但在当前硬件与在线控制约束下仍缺少联合验证。后续需要继续做系统性查新，特别关注质量估计、动态停止和 SSVEP control-state 文献。"}}
{"id":"sl/jetc3ut0","index":10,"title":"7  拟议创新点与主要贡献","elements":[{"id":"sh/7650nq5s","kind":"textbox","text":"7  拟议创新点与主要贡献","position":{"left":40,"top":36,"width":1010,"height":55}},{"id":"sh/xcryxg7y","kind":"shape","position":{"left":1085,"top":42,"width":112,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/wbih4b6d","kind":"textbox","text":"创新候选","position":{"left":1088,"top":43,"width":106,"height":32}},{"id":"sh/n69grmpw","kind":"textbox","text":"候选题目：质量感知、重叠感知的个人校准 SSVEP 在线解码框架","position":{"left":65,"top":110,"width":1150,"height":50}},{"id":"sh/250zy18b","kind":"shape","position":{"left":60,"top":190,"width":555,"height":165}},{"id":"sh/98rytw72","kind":"shape","position":{"left":60,"top":190,"width":8,"height":165}},{"id":"sh/o7ih0r6h","kind":"textbox","text":"贡献 1｜一致校准协议","position":{"left":78,"top":204,"width":519,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/72t03qp0","kind":"textbox","text":"单目标引导时保留与六目标测试相同的尺寸、位置与背景，只让目标位置闪烁，减少域差异。","position":{"left":78,"top":246,"width":519,"height":95}},{"id":"sh/61kzalof","kind":"shape","position":{"left":665,"top":190,"width":555,"height":165}},{"id":"sh/ofqtgnyt","kind":"shape","position":{"left":665,"top":190,"width":8,"height":165}},{"id":"sh/9gza9sze","kind":"textbox","text":"贡献 2｜质量感知个人解码","position":{"left":683,"top":204,"width":519,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/mdobedg3","kind":"textbox","text":"用通道 SNR、工频污染与跨试次可重复性生成权重，融合 TDCA/eTRCA 与 FBCCA。","position":{"left":683,"top":246,"width":519,"height":95}},{"id":"sh/nehs7iho","kind":"shape","position":{"left":60,"top":385,"width":555,"height":165}},{"id":"sh/0b6tc3yx","kind":"shape","position":{"left":60,"top":385,"width":8,"height":165}},{"id":"sh/1cfa58zi","kind":"textbox","text":"贡献 3｜重叠感知序贯证据","position":{"left":78,"top":399,"width":519,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/epobatgr","kind":"textbox","text":"每 0.25 s 更新时只按新增信息比例累积证据，避免把 93.75% 重叠窗口当作独立投票。","position":{"left":78,"top":441,"width":519,"height":95}},{"id":"sh/zaxs3yhc","kind":"shape","position":{"left":665,"top":385,"width":555,"height":165}},{"id":"sh/cn6t83y1","kind":"shape","position":{"left":665,"top":385,"width":8,"height":165}},{"id":"sh/dofa18z6","kind":"textbox","text":"贡献 4｜显式 idle / 释放状态","position":{"left":683,"top":399,"width":519,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/tsnip0ny","kind":"textbox","text":"把“不发指令”和“释放旧指令”纳入状态机，以 FTR/min 与延迟共同优化控制安全性。","position":{"left":683,"top":441,"width":519,"height":95}},{"id":"sh/87ehgv6d","kind":"textbox","text":"严谨表述：这是拟议框架与创新候选；需完成查新、消融和跨会话在线实验后，才能声称有效或新颖。","position":{"left":80,"top":590,"width":1120,"height":62}}],"notes":{"text":"‘个人模板 + FBCCA’不是创新；TRCA/TDCA、通道选择、自适应窗和动态停止都有文献。可能形成论文贡献的是：在同一在线问题中，给出质量估计、重叠证据校正和控制状态的一体化方法，并用严格的在线指标与消融证明每一部分的必要性。这里暂不声称世界首创。"}}
{"id":"sl/8f2psfyx","index":11,"title":"8.1  提出方法的总体结构","elements":[{"id":"sh/d8nqxkf2","kind":"textbox","text":"8.1  提出方法的总体结构","position":{"left":40,"top":36,"width":1010,"height":55}},{"id":"sh/1gbm9s3a","kind":"shape","position":{"left":1085,"top":42,"width":112,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/0f2lgnmp","kind":"textbox","text":"方法","position":{"left":1088,"top":43,"width":106,"height":32}},{"id":"sh/ra943il8","kind":"shape","position":{"left":45,"top":190,"width":165,"height":180}},{"id":"sh/q903ad4n","kind":"textbox","text":"① 一致校准","position":{"left":55,"top":207,"width":145,"height":44}},{"id":"sh/dcbm583y","kind":"textbox","text":"相同布局\n单目标引导","position":{"left":57,"top":270,"width":141,"height":70}},{"id":"sh/sb2lcnmd","kind":"shape","position":{"left":214,"top":265,"width":28,"height":24}},{"id":"sh/b6d4f2lc","kind":"shape","position":{"left":248,"top":190,"width":165,"height":180}},{"id":"sh/a543mx4r","kind":"textbox","text":"② 质量评估","position":{"left":258,"top":207,"width":145,"height":44}},{"id":"sh/wvupgz6t","kind":"textbox","text":"SNR / 50 Hz\n可重复性","position":{"left":260,"top":270,"width":141,"height":70}},{"id":"sh/xw3q94ne","kind":"shape","position":{"left":417,"top":265,"width":28,"height":24}},{"id":"sh/atc7epon","kind":"shape","position":{"left":451,"top":190,"width":165,"height":180}},{"id":"sh/bulo7u58","kind":"textbox","text":"③ 个人解码","position":{"left":461,"top":207,"width":145,"height":44}},{"id":"sh/orapcf6h","kind":"textbox","text":"TDCA / eTRCA\n模板分数","position":{"left":463,"top":270,"width":141,"height":70}},{"id":"sh/9sj65kn2","kind":"shape","position":{"left":620,"top":265,"width":28,"height":24}},{"id":"sh/mps7a5or","kind":"shape","position":{"left":654,"top":190,"width":165,"height":180}},{"id":"sh/nq1o3a5w","kind":"textbox","text":"④ 无训练证据","position":{"left":664,"top":207,"width":145,"height":44}},{"id":"sh/0nap8f6l","kind":"textbox","text":"FBCCA\n频率谐波","position":{"left":666,"top":270,"width":141,"height":70}},{"id":"sh/1oj61kn6","kind":"shape","position":{"left":823,"top":265,"width":28,"height":24}},{"id":"sh/hkbm5wzu","kind":"shape","position":{"left":857,"top":190,"width":165,"height":180}},{"id":"sh/gj25cry9","kind":"textbox","text":"⑤ 序贯融合","position":{"left":867,"top":207,"width":145,"height":44}},{"id":"sh/fit436ho","kind":"textbox","text":"重叠校正\n动态停止","position":{"left":869,"top":270,"width":141,"height":70}},{"id":"sh/uh0na1g3","kind":"shape","position":{"left":1026,"top":265,"width":28,"height":24}},{"id":"sh/tgrm1wzy","kind":"shape","position":{"left":1060,"top":190,"width":165,"height":180}},{"id":"sh/sfi58ryd","kind":"textbox","text":"⑥ 控制状态","position":{"left":1070,"top":207,"width":145,"height":44}},{"id":"sh/7u94zmhs","kind":"textbox","text":"idle / 释放\n安全触发","position":{"left":1072,"top":270,"width":141,"height":70}},{"id":"sh/6t0n6hg7","kind":"textbox","text":"训练阶段","position":{"left":45,"top":145,"width":565,"height":34}},{"id":"sh/dcv6dgz2","kind":"textbox","text":"在线阶段","position":{"left":654,"top":145,"width":609,"height":34}},{"id":"sh/cbm5kbyh","kind":"shape","position":{"left":75,"top":440,"width":350,"height":155}},{"id":"sh/alwbitsn","kind":"shape","position":{"left":75,"top":440,"width":8,"height":155}},{"id":"sh/bm5sryt8","kind":"textbox","text":"输入","position":{"left":93,"top":454,"width":314,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/wnetkjat","kind":"textbox","text":"后枕区多通道 EEG\n刺激频率 8–13 Hz\n4 s 主窗 / 0.25 s 更新","position":{"left":93,"top":496,"width":314,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/xonutobe","kind":"shape","position":{"left":465,"top":440,"width":350,"height":155}},{"id":"sh/mhcbe9sr","kind":"shape","position":{"left":465,"top":440,"width":8,"height":155}},{"id":"sh/nilsnetc","kind":"textbox","text":"输出","position":{"left":483,"top":454,"width":314,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/ojutgjah","kind":"textbox","text":"六类指令概率 + idle 概率\n置信度、间隔与有效证据量","position":{"left":483,"top":496,"width":314,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/9k3apob2","kind":"shape","position":{"left":855,"top":440,"width":350,"height":155}},{"id":"sh/6dgbqdsv","kind":"shape","position":{"left":855,"top":440,"width":8,"height":155}},{"id":"sh/7epczitg","kind":"textbox","text":"优化目标","position":{"left":873,"top":454,"width":314,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/r6l8vaxw","kind":"textbox","text":"最大化在线正确率与 ITR\n最小化 FTR/min 与响应延迟","position":{"left":873,"top":496,"width":314,"height":85}},{"id":"sh/q5c7m5wb","kind":"textbox","text":"所有权重和阈值只在训练折 / 校准集确定；测试会话只做一次前向推理","position":{"left":42,"top":691,"width":1120,"height":20}}],"notes":{"text":"总体结构是研究假设，不是已完成算法。训练与测试必须按会话分开，避免同一连续记录切出的相邻窗口落入训练和验证，造成数据泄漏。"}}
{"id":"sl/hgzapcr6","index":12,"title":"8.2  质量感知的个人解码","elements":[{"id":"sh/6l4fu547","kind":"textbox","text":"8.2  质量感知的个人解码","position":{"left":40,"top":36,"width":1010,"height":55}},{"id":"sh/q50nydsj","kind":"shape","position":{"left":1085,"top":42,"width":112,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/bq9orito","kind":"textbox","text":"方法细节","position":{"left":1088,"top":43,"width":106,"height":32}},{"id":"sh/o3i5w3ad","kind":"shape","position":{"left":55,"top":125,"width":360,"height":470}},{"id":"sh/p4r6p8by","kind":"shape","position":{"left":55,"top":125,"width":8,"height":470}},{"id":"sh/21gnuts7","kind":"textbox","text":"A. 通道质量权重","position":{"left":73,"top":139,"width":324,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/32ponyts","kind":"textbox","text":"对每个通道 c 估计：\n\n• 目标频段 SNR\n• 50 Hz 污染比例\n• 重复试次相关性\n• 幅值饱和 / 漂移\n\n得到 0–1 权重 q_c，并对低质量通道降权，而不是固定选四个通道。","position":{"left":73,"top":181,"width":324,"height":400}},{"id":"sh/gzy5s3a1","kind":"shape","position":{"left":460,"top":125,"width":360,"height":470}},{"id":"sh/1076lobm","kind":"shape","position":{"left":460,"top":125,"width":8,"height":470}},{"id":"sh/hcfy9k3u","kind":"textbox","text":"B. 两类互补证据","position":{"left":478,"top":139,"width":324,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/gb6x0zm9","kind":"textbox","text":"TDCA / eTRCA：利用个人重复试次的时空模板，提高个体判别性。\n\nFBCCA：利用频率与谐波的物理先验，在模板漂移或校准不足时提供保底证据。","position":{"left":478,"top":181,"width":324,"height":400}},{"id":"sh/vaxg7ulo","kind":"shape","position":{"left":865,"top":125,"width":360,"height":470}},{"id":"sh/u9ofyp43","kind":"shape","position":{"left":865,"top":125,"width":8,"height":470}},{"id":"sh/t8fy5k3i","kind":"textbox","text":"C. 训练内确定融合","position":{"left":883,"top":139,"width":324,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/876xwfmx","kind":"textbox","text":"X′_c = q_c · X_c\n\np_t = α_t p_TDCA\n      + (1−α_t) p_FBCCA\n\nα_t 由训练折的质量特征估计；阈值只在训练/校准数据上选择。","position":{"left":883,"top":181,"width":324,"height":400}},{"id":"sh/7mdg3als","kind":"textbox","text":"关键对比：固定通道 vs 质量加权；FBCCA vs TDCA；固定 α vs 自适应 α。","position":{"left":85,"top":620,"width":1110,"height":45}}],"notes":{"text":"公式表达的是拟议方案。质量特征应在每次佩戴后用无标签或校准数据估计，并通过训练折确定到概率映射。可从 eTRCA/TDCA 开始，因为它们比 Transformer 更适合当前的小样本个人校准场景。TDCA 参考：https://bingchuanliu.github.io/assets/pdf/liu_tnsre.pdf；TRCA 参考：https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28436836/"}}
{"id":"sl/6lsnupw7","index":13,"title":"8.3  重叠感知的序贯判决","elements":[{"id":"sh/kzy5on2p","kind":"textbox","text":"8.3  重叠感知的序贯判决","position":{"left":40,"top":36,"width":1010,"height":55}},{"id":"sh/xc7eds76","kind":"shape","position":{"left":1085,"top":42,"width":112,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/wbydknq1","kind":"textbox","text":"方法细节","position":{"left":1088,"top":43,"width":106,"height":32}},{"id":"sh/jepwf2pc","kind":"shape","position":{"left":55,"top":125,"width":360,"height":215}},{"id":"sh/idgvmx8r","kind":"shape","position":{"left":55,"top":125,"width":8,"height":215}},{"id":"sh/5grehs7i","kind":"textbox","text":"重叠量","position":{"left":73,"top":139,"width":324,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/kfidonqx","kind":"textbox","text":"窗口长度 L，更新步长 S\n重叠率 r = 1 − S/L\n新增信息比例 Δn = S/L\n\n论文：Δn = 0.125\n当前：Δn = 0.0625","position":{"left":73,"top":181,"width":324,"height":145}},{"id":"sh/zi5c3y98","kind":"shape","position":{"left":460,"top":125,"width":360,"height":215}},{"id":"sh/ehwvat8n","kind":"shape","position":{"left":460,"top":125,"width":8,"height":215}},{"id":"sh/c3e1gjyd","kind":"textbox","text":"初版证据累积","position":{"left":478,"top":139,"width":324,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/x4ni9ofy","kind":"textbox","text":"E_t = E_{t−1} + Δn · log[(p₁+ε)/(p₂+ε)]\n\n只按新增样本比例累积分数，避免相邻窗口被完整重复计票。","position":{"left":478,"top":181,"width":324,"height":145}},{"id":"sh/a1wze9g7","kind":"shape","position":{"left":865,"top":125,"width":360,"height":215}},{"id":"sh/b2507exs","kind":"shape","position":{"left":865,"top":125,"width":8,"height":215}},{"id":"sh/kre1k3y9","kind":"textbox","text":"触发 / 释放","position":{"left":883,"top":139,"width":324,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/ls7idofu","kind":"textbox","text":"触发：E_t > θ_on 且质量合格\n保持：同类证据持续\n释放：idle > θ_off 或质量失效\n冷却：防止短时重复发送","position":{"left":883,"top":181,"width":324,"height":145}},{"id":"sh/y5wjitgj","kind":"shape","position":{"left":65,"top":410,"width":198,"height":105}},{"id":"sh/z650byxo","kind":"textbox","text":"1","position":{"left":75,"top":426,"width":42,"height":42}},{"id":"sh/0buh8zy5","kind":"textbox","text":"读取本窗概率与质量","position":{"left":120,"top":423,"width":132,"height":58}},{"id":"sh/1w3i14fq","kind":"shape","position":{"left":266,"top":450,"width":28,"height":20}},{"id":"sh/hsvy50re","kind":"shape","position":{"left":303,"top":410,"width":198,"height":105}},{"id":"sh/grmxwvqt","kind":"textbox","text":"2","position":{"left":313,"top":426,"width":42,"height":42}},{"id":"sh/fqdg3q98","kind":"textbox","text":"估计有效新增证据","position":{"left":358,"top":423,"width":132,"height":58}},{"id":"sh/up4fal83","kind":"shape","position":{"left":504,"top":450,"width":28,"height":20}},{"id":"sh/pwvy90rq","kind":"shape","position":{"left":541,"top":410,"width":198,"height":105}},{"id":"sh/4vmh0vq5","kind":"textbox","text":"3","position":{"left":551,"top":426,"width":42,"height":42}},{"id":"sh/3udg7q9k","kind":"textbox","text":"更新类证据与 idle","position":{"left":596,"top":423,"width":132,"height":58}},{"id":"sh/2t4fyl8z","kind":"shape","position":{"left":742,"top":450,"width":28,"height":20}},{"id":"sh/d0fydk7m","kind":"shape","position":{"left":779,"top":410,"width":198,"height":105}},{"id":"sh/cz6h4fq1","kind":"textbox","text":"4","position":{"left":789,"top":426,"width":42,"height":42}},{"id":"sh/atg3idk7","kind":"textbox","text":"达到阈值才触发","position":{"left":834,"top":423,"width":132,"height":58}},{"id":"sh/bup4rils","kind":"shape","position":{"left":980,"top":450,"width":28,"height":20}},{"id":"sh/cvylkn2d","kind":"shape","position":{"left":1017,"top":410,"width":198,"height":105}},{"id":"sh/xw7mts3y","kind":"textbox","text":"5","position":{"left":1027,"top":426,"width":42,"height":42}},{"id":"sh/yxgnmxkj","kind":"textbox","text":"记录延迟和误触发","position":{"left":1072,"top":423,"width":132,"height":58}},{"id":"sh/jyp4fil4","kind":"textbox","text":"该公式只是可实现的第一版假设；后续可用相关性估计、贝叶斯滤波或 HMM 替代，需要消融实验决定。","position":{"left":85,"top":570,"width":1110,"height":65}}],"notes":{"text":"这里不要宣称公式已经证明。它把‘4 秒窗口每 0.25 秒更新’的直观问题显式化：每次更新只有 6.25% 新样本。初版可以作为 baseline，再与普通 consecutive voting、动态窗口、HMM/贝叶斯证据累积比较。一般重叠窗口独立性讨论：https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3634773/"}}
{"id":"sl/vaxsvy10","index":14,"title":"9.1  实验设计：如何验证方法有效？","elements":[{"id":"sh/t87ml0ji","kind":"textbox","text":"9.1  实验设计：如何验证方法有效？","position":{"left":40,"top":36,"width":1010,"height":55}},{"id":"sh/547mhg3m","kind":"shape","position":{"left":1085,"top":42,"width":112,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/k3y5ov21","kind":"textbox","text":"实验","position":{"left":1088,"top":43,"width":106,"height":32}},{"id":"tb/qdszm98j","kind":"table","text":"维度\t设计\t对照 / 消融\t主要输出\n数据划分\t按会话分组，禁止相邻窗跨集合\t随机切窗划分作为泄漏警示\t跨会话 ACC、Macro-F1\n离线基线\tFBCCA、eTRCA、TDCA、当前个人融合、Transformer\t同通道、同窗口、同频率\t类别混淆矩阵、校准曲线\n在线任务\t提示目标 → 注视 → 空闲；每类随机多轮\t普通连续确认 vs 动态停止\t指令正确率、FTR/min、Latency\n质量消融\t去掉 q_c / 固定四通道\t质量加权完整模型\t坏通道条件下性能下降\n重叠消融\t不修正 / Δn 修正 / 相关性估计\t2 s 与 4 s，多种步长\t稳定性、误触发、ITR\n安全验证\t先模拟器，后低风险实机\t启用/禁用 idle 释放\t错误动作数、停止成功率","position":{"left":55,"top":120,"width":1170,"height":460}},{"id":"sh/65gnqlk7","kind":"textbox","text":"统计要求：报告均值±置信区间；按试次或会话做配对比较；预先固定阈值与停止规则。","position":{"left":80,"top":608,"width":1120,"height":46}}],"notes":{"text":"实验建议分三阶段：1）跨会话离线；2）有提示的在线闭环但不控制真实无人机；3）安全约束下实机。第一阶段必须先把标准答案和数据划分做对。避免同一连续 EEG 切出的相邻窗口同时进入训练与验证，这会因高重叠造成严重泄漏。"}}
{"id":"sl/gny5sjyp","index":15,"title":"9.2  当前基线与验证状态","elements":[{"id":"sh/nqlg3a5k","kind":"textbox","text":"9.2  当前基线与验证状态","position":{"left":40,"top":36,"width":1010,"height":55}},{"id":"sh/8z2h8bq1","kind":"shape","position":{"left":1085,"top":42,"width":112,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/9kby1g7m","kind":"textbox","text":"实验现状","position":{"left":1088,"top":43,"width":106,"height":32}},{"id":"ch/edsvy547","kind":"chart","name":"Chart","position":{"left":60,"top":145,"width":520,"height":360}},{"id":"sh/zutgvm94","kind":"shape","position":{"left":630,"top":135,"width":575,"height":220}},{"id":"sh/kv2h4rqp","kind":"shape","position":{"left":630,"top":135,"width":8,"height":220}},{"id":"sh/lwbyxwra","kind":"textbox","text":"已完成","position":{"left":648,"top":149,"width":539,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/ip4zel83","kind":"textbox","text":"✓ 八通道接入与实时显示\n✓ 六频刺激与 FBCCA 流程\n✓ 60 段单目标个人校准数据\n✓ Transformer 基线与个人模板基线\n✓ 已记录通道质量和窗口配置","position":{"left":648,"top":191,"width":539,"height":150}},{"id":"sh/3qdg7qpo","kind":"shape","position":{"left":630,"top":385,"width":575,"height":220}},{"id":"sh/fm1gzq5o","kind":"shape","position":{"left":630,"top":385,"width":8,"height":220}},{"id":"sh/e1sf65o3","kind":"textbox","text":"尚未完成（决定论文可信度）","position":{"left":648,"top":399,"width":539,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/1ojy10ne","kind":"textbox","text":"□ 独立的有提示在线测试集\n□ 跨会话复测\n□ eTRCA / TDCA 强基线\n□ FTR/min、Latency、ITR\n□ 质量与重叠模块消融\n□ 刺激实际频率的光电验证","position":{"left":648,"top":441,"width":539,"height":150}},{"id":"sh/gnax8v6t","kind":"textbox","text":"当前证据只能支持“发现了问题并建立了基线”，不能支持“新方法已有效”。","position":{"left":90,"top":625,"width":1100,"height":42}}],"notes":{"text":"论文设置来自本地论文 /Users/geniusalu/Desktop/论文.pdf：2 s window, 0.25 s stride, 87.5% overlap。当前项目为 4 s / 0.25 s，93.75%。当前仅有软件时序日志，刺激频率尚未用光电二极管或高速相机做物理验证。个人模板 38.3% 是留一试次内部一致性，不放到‘在线准确率’栏。"}}
{"id":"sl/14bup87q","index":16,"title":"10  总结与下一步","elements":[{"id":"sh/fm58bm54","kind":"textbox","text":"10  总结与下一步","position":{"left":40,"top":36,"width":1010,"height":55}},{"id":"sh/1c7e50ni","kind":"shape","position":{"left":1085,"top":42,"width":112,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/gbedwfmx","kind":"textbox","text":"总结","position":{"left":1088,"top":43,"width":106,"height":32}},{"id":"sh/rm5czq50","kind":"shape","position":{"left":65,"top":135,"width":350,"height":410}},{"id":"sh/6lwvql4v","kind":"shape","position":{"left":65,"top":135,"width":8,"height":410}},{"id":"sh/t8ne10n6","kind":"textbox","text":"已经明确的问题","position":{"left":83,"top":149,"width":314,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/snedsvml","kind":"textbox","text":"1. 低信号质量与通道波动\n\n2. 单目标校准与六目标测试不一致\n\n3. 高度重叠窗口使连续确认相关\n\n4. 缺少 idle/释放与在线标准答案","position":{"left":83,"top":191,"width":314,"height":340}},{"id":"sh/jilcvq54","kind":"shape","position":{"left":465,"top":135,"width":350,"height":410}},{"id":"sh/ihcvml4j","kind":"shape","position":{"left":465,"top":135,"width":8,"height":410}},{"id":"sh/4by9or6l","kind":"textbox","text":"拟议解决方案","position":{"left":483,"top":149,"width":314,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/pc7qhwn6","kind":"textbox","text":"1. 一致布局的个人校准\n\n2. 质量感知 TDCA/eTRCA + FBCCA\n\n3. 重叠感知序贯证据\n\n4. 显式控制状态与多指标优化","position":{"left":483,"top":191,"width":314,"height":340}},{"id":"sh/29grm1of","kind":"shape","position":{"left":865,"top":135,"width":350,"height":410}},{"id":"sh/3ap8fm50","kind":"shape","position":{"left":865,"top":135,"width":8,"height":410}},{"id":"sh/gnepkr69","kind":"textbox","text":"下一步最小闭环","position":{"left":883,"top":149,"width":314,"height":36}},{"id":"sh/honqdwnu","kind":"textbox","text":"1. 实现 eTRCA/TDCA 强基线\n\n2. 采集独立、随机、有提示在线测试\n\n3. 做跨会话与消融\n\n4. 根据结果收缩创新点并写论文","position":{"left":883,"top":191,"width":314,"height":340}},{"id":"sh/ulw7ihoj","kind":"textbox","text":"建议向老师提出：请重点指导“质量估计 + 重叠感知在线决策”是否具有足够研究价值，以及优先选 TDCA 还是 eTRCA 作为主体算法。","position":{"left":85,"top":585,"width":1110,"height":75}}],"notes":{"text":"汇报收口：现在已有系统与真实失败证据，可以向老师说明为什么不是简单调阈值或换 Transformer。最值得老师拍板的是：①研究问题是否收敛到在线稳定性；②主体解码器选 TDCA 还是 eTRCA；③重叠感知和控制状态是否作为论文主要创新；④实验样本量与安全流程。"}}
{"id":"sl/y5wne50z","index":17,"title":"感 谢 各 位 专 家","elements":[{"id":"sh/wrelszu9","kind":"textbox","name":"文本框 1","text":"感 谢 各 位 专 家\n请批评指正","position":{"left":316.3,"top":217.69,"width":621.99,"height":268.8}},{"id":"sh/rip4retw","kind":"textbox","name":"副标题 8","text":"南京信息工程大学自动化学院","position":{"left":66.67,"top":32.47,"width":528.07,"height":52.13}}],"notes":{"text":"建议现场重点请教：主体算法选择、创新边界、实验规模和在线安全评价指标。"}}